---
import SectionContainer from "../containers/SectionContainer.astro";
import CustomLink from "@/components/CustomLink.astro";
---

<SectionContainer>
  <div class="flex flex-col space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-medium">Faisal M</h2>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-[1.68]">
      I'm Faisal, an ordinary person with an interest in writing and web
      development. I created this blog as a record and to implement the learning
      that I have gone through on web development. My journey in learning web
      development and what I am adding to this blog can be found in the{" "}
      <CustomLink variant="secondary" href="/programming">
        programming
      </CustomLink>{" "}
      section. The rest can be found in the{" "}
      <CustomLink variant="secondary" href="/general"> general </CustomLink>{
        " "
      }
      and{" "}
      <CustomLink variant="secondary" href="/movies"> movies </CustomLink>{" "}
      section for what interests me. This blog is open source. Source code can be
      found{" "}
      <CustomLink
        variant="secondary"
        href="https://github.com/faisalm29/faisalm"
      >
        here
      </CustomLink>
      .
    </p>
  </div>
</SectionContainer>
